        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M5FMTD9QmsBf1sCgMCIv-403" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;This&amp;nbsp; column of has two input element, one on far left another on far right.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;On far left is input for month &amp;amp; year from where to view analytics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;On far right is conditional number input, a number that represents a day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;in a selected month. this is contional , it has to be enabled. once enabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;analytics are viewed for chosen day. once disabled analytics are viewed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;for chosen month only and this is default analytics view.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" parent="M5FMTD9QmsBf1sCgMCIv-402" vertex="1" connectable="0">
